          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "An account exercises authority when it helps determine what can appear as a case, who can speak about it, and what can be done to the person it describes. This lens follows that operation in the episteme register: the encounter between a practice of knowing and the relations that make its objects actionable — beyond accuracy to the authority acquired through describing.",
