          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "“The approachable limit is the basis of investigation; the absolute limit is the basis of faith; the limit of investigation is the limit of determination; the limit of faith is never to be determined.”\n\nInvestigation approaches something that can become more determinate. The resulting knowledge changes what can next be asked and done — the positive capacity to enter a question and make a difference within it.",
